            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nI personally don't think `--stat` is that much useful to be included by default. I'll take some time to probably reconsider, though.\r\n\r\nIn the meantime I can suggest using custom mapping with `<Cmd>Git show --stat --patch <cword><CR>` as right hand side to achieve this.",
