        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "After thinking about it a bit more and trying to observe how I look at commit information in LazyGit, the commit statistics indeed seems to be useful. Pity that it does not get highlighted inside \"git\" filetype, but it still is useful for an overview for commit impact.\r\n\r\nThis should be resolved on latest `main`. Thanks again for the suggestion!",
